[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m [response] To find the largest possible real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(z\) is a complex number with \(|z| = 4\), we can proceed as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 1. Let \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). This represents all possible values of \(z\) with magnitude 4.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 2. Substitute \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression and simplify.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 3. Separate the real and imaginary parts of the resulting expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 4. Maximize the real part of the expression with respect to \(\theta\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m Let's start by substituting \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4e^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 4(75 + 117i)e^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}e^{-i\theta} = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m Now we expand this expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 4(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i (24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m Combining like terms, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
