[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m (4 \cdot 75 \cos \theta - 4 \cdot 117 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i (4 \cdot 75 \sin \theta + 4 \cdot 117 \cos \theta + 24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m Simplifying further:
