[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m (300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i (300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta + 24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta)
