[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m Simplifying this, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m To find the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\), we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -432\), so the maximum value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=10888)[0m 
